<title>POLAND: GORAZDZE SEEKS SHARES IN CEMENT MAKER.</title>
<headline>GORAZDZE SEEKS SHARES IN CEMENT MAKER.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish cement firm Gorazdze SA will seek to buy smaller cement maker Groszowice from National Investment Fund (NFI) Hetman despite the anti-monopoly office's Thursday disapproval of such a sale, Hetman's president said.</p>
<p>&quot;For the time being we're not looking for new offers. We'll be talking with Gorazdze, who have said they will protest the decision,&quot; Krzysztof Sedzikowski told Reuters.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
